STUN LEVEL!  Drawing comparisons to Gauntlet may be a good idea.  Gauntlet
had the equivalent of a short-term potion of paralysis, the stun level.
And you could literally stun someone right out of the game, pushing them
into a ghost generator or something.  And, you normally put out real
money for this game.  But the group of people I played with kept
coming back.  Gauntlet was best played as a *cooperative* game,
however.  An interesting thought for NetHack...

